# Marimo
__marimo__/

# ============================================================
# Cross-machine consistency (machineB, 2026-06-01)
# Track ALL scripts (.py) and docs (.md) repo-wide so two machines stay in sync,
# even inside otherwise-ignored directories. Experiment results / temp / trash / data stay ignored.
# Per dir: un-ignore the tree, re-ignore its contents, then re-include ONLY .py/.md.
# ============================================================

# comparison/ framework
!comparison/
comparison/**
!comparison/**/
!comparison/**/*.py
!comparison/**/*.md

# scripts/ablation/
!scripts/ablation/
scripts/ablation/**
!scripts/ablation/**/
!scripts/ablation/**/*.py
!scripts/ablation/**/*.md

# mae_anomaly/visualization/
!mae_anomaly/visualization/
mae_anomaly/visualization/**
!mae_anomaly/visualization/**/
!mae_anomaly/visualization/**/*.py
!mae_anomaly/visualization/**/*.md

# docs/ablation/
!docs/ablation/
docs/ablation/**
!docs/ablation/**/
!docs/ablation/**/*.py
!docs/ablation/**/*.md

# .claude/ (markdown agent/skill/doc files only; machine-local settings*.json stay untracked)
!.claude/
.claude/**
!.claude/**/
!.claude/**/*.md

# dataset/ (loader scripts only; large data files stay ignored)
!dataset/
dataset/**
!dataset/**/
!dataset/**/*.py
!dataset/**/*.md

# file-pattern-excluded scripts + root docs (run_*.py, eval_*.py, visualize_all.py, CLAUDE.md, ...)
!scripts/*.py
!CLAUDE.md
!ablation_guideline.md

# --- hard re-exclude: these MUST stay ignored regardless of the negations above ---
temp/
.trash/
trash/
results/*/
